{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>美國貿易代表署周五（13日）在社交媒體發文，表示部門與美國財政部一起，和中國官員召開了兩國貿易理事會首次正式會議。帖文說，期待與中國繼續接觸，在全球最大的兩個經濟體之間建立公平、平衡的貿易往來。（美國貿易代表署社交媒體X）</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-14T04:19:19.871524+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":111,"images":0,"source":"明報 中國","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-14T03:39:32+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-14T07:14:57.959698+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-14T04:12:47.092876+00:00","content_hash":"9b14f9956b3985b9f6495e4dbbf025e2915eac686e66af9056ae7cea77d9c222","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}